EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}AHH! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I have to talk with {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}
about {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}something really important!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}But I can't go out looking like this.
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} You look presentable. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Would
you go out and grab {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} for
me? {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Be back within {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}an hour{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
But of course!
Sorry. I can't.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Accipicchia! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Devo parlare con
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} di una cosa {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}importante!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ma non posso certo uscire così.
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Che idea!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} Tu sei presentabile.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Vall{{TAG:000E:0008:01CD02006F000200610002003000}} a chiamare tu per me!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Poi tornate qui entro {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}un'ora{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Certo!
No, non posso.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Falımın söylediğine göre,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
bir arkadaşımla önemli
bir konuşma yapacakmışım.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tam da {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} ile konuşmam gerekiyor; {{TAG:000E:0007:0600680069006D000600680065007200}}
kişisini bulup {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}bir saat içinde{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} geri
gelir misin?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Tabii!
Eh.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}No worries.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} You must be busy with
something,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} like, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}totally important.{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
I'll take care of it myself!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Non ti preoccupare.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Avrai anche tu
le tue faccende,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} cioè, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}importanti.{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
Me la caverò da sola!
